   - `sycl::range<N>`, `sycl::nd_range<N>`, `sycl::id<N>` → N ∈ {1, 2, 3} ONLY
   - `sycl::local_accessor<T, N>`, `sycl::accessor<T, N>` → N ∈ {1, 2, 3} ONLY
   - Using N=4 or higher causes static_assert compile failures!
   - **For 4D+ data (e.g., Conv3d with batch×channel×D×H×W)**: Linearize higher dimensions into 1D/2D/3D:
     ```cpp
